  "totalBlocks": 12,
  "translatedBlocks": 12,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a1c6385abff57b0",
      "translationZh": "刚刚发布了 pi-automode-classifier，这是一个用于 Pi 编程智能体的自动模式插件，使用 Jev 或在本地运行的 Kev / Laya 对命令进行分类。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d64b43be37e568f6",
      "translationZh": "Pi 执行每一次工具调用时都不会请求批准。这个插件会在每条 shell 命令运行前对其进行检查：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6edcc10d4b20b127",
      "translationZh": "内置规则决定大多数命令的处理方式。例如，ls、构建和测试可以运行，rm -rf ~ 会被阻止，而 git push 和 sudo 需要我的批准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ae51bb0447b64d8c",
      "translationZh": "规则无法识别的命令会被发送给模型。模型会返回该命令存在风险的概率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d97539c6e947120c",
      "translationZh": "如果概率高于某个阈值，我就会收到确认提示。模型本身绝不会阻止命令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4146920ab876b5b1",
      "translationZh": "通过 OpenRouter 使用 Jev 1.13（由 TypeSafe 提供的托管服务）：每次检查约 270 ms，每 1,000 次检查约 1.5 美分。命令会被发送给 OpenRouter 和 TypeSafe。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "33a1b4062c19d768",
      "translationZh": "使用 llama.cpp 在 CPU 上运行 Kev-0.8B：每次检查约 170 ms，占用 1.1 GB 的 RAM。我用的就是这个。没有任何内容会离开本机。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "78fbb6dbfc03ad94",
      "translationZh": "使用 llama.cpp 在 CPU 上运行 Laya typed-decisions：每次检查约 100 ms，占用约 550 MB 的 RAM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eafa58f8b9eae6a5",
      "translationZh": "在我用 50 条命令（25 条安全命令，25 条有风险的命令）进行的测试中，所有安全命令都在没有提示确认的情况下运行了，而有风险的命令没有一条在未经提示确认的情况下运行。测试命令是我自己编写的，因此这只是一次粗略的检查。这个插件不是沙箱。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "329c3848ed50422c",
      "translationZh": "代码和文档：https://github.com/deepu105/pi-automode-classifier",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "509fb2aff46a313e",
      "translationZh": "如果它放行或拦截了不该放行或拦截的内容，请告诉我。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f932f7eb2c02b304",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/deepu105 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
